crimlab (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Rules a table must satisfy (valrules and the rule functions), drift of
    a whole table (drfttab, drftcal) and Cramer's V (cramerv), from the
    command line and in every language.
  * The notice of a newer release is off unless asked for.

